   "text": "Agenda Page 1 of 3 February 10 th Township Council Regular Meeting As of: 2/10/2026 ROCKAWAY TOWNSHIP REGULAR MEETING AGENDA VIEW ON YOUTUBE HERE FEBRUARY 10th, 2026 7:00PM 1. CALL TO ORDER 2. COUNCIL PRESIDENT TO LEAD THOSE PRESENT IN THE SALUTE TO THE AMERICAN FLAG 3. MOMENT OF SILENCE TO REMEMBER THE SERVICE AND SACRIFICES OF THE ARMED SERVICE MEMBERS WHO PROTECT OUR NATION AND THE FIRST RESPONDERS WHO PROTECT OUR NEIGHBORHOODS 4. ROLL CALL 5. ADEQUATE NOTICE OF THIS MEETING WAS PROVIDED TO THE DAILY RECORD AND THE OFFICIAL NEWSPAPERS FOR THE TOWNSHIP OF ROCKAWAY. NOTICE WAS POSTED ON THE OFFICIAL BULLETIN BOARDS OF ROCKAWAY TOWNSHIP, THE TOWNSHIP WEBSITE, AND NOTICE WAS FILED IN THE OFFICE OF THE TOWNSHIP CLERK. 6. APPROVAL OF MINUTE(S): A. JANUARY 20 TH TOWNSHIP COUNCIL CLOSED SESSION MEETING MINUTES 7. MAYOR ’ S APPOINTMENT Labor Counsel - Hatfield Schwartz Law Group 8. ORDINANCE(S) FOR INTRODUCTION: O-26-01 ORDINANCE PROVIDING FOR PFAS REMEDIATION IN AND BY THE TOWNSHIP OF ROCKAWAY, IN THE COUNTY OF MORRIS, NEW JERSEY, AND APPROPRIATING $864,737.74 THEREFOR FROM MONIES AVAILABLE IN THE RESERVE FOR PFAS REMEDIATION OF THE TOWNSHIP. O-26-02 AN ORDINANCE AMENDING CHAPTER 2 “ ADMINISTRATIVE CODE ” , ARTICLE IX, SECTION 2-48.4 “ WEDDING AND CIVIL UNION CEREMONIES ” , OF THE REVISED GENERAL ORDINANCES OF THE TOWNSHIP OF ROCKAWAY O-26-03 AN ORDINANCE AMENDING CHAPTER 54 ENTITLED \"LAND USE AND DEVELOPMENT\" OF THE CODE OF THE TOWNSHIP OF ROCKAWAY AMENDING SECTION 54-30.52 ENTITLED \"R-B MFO REGIONAL BUSINESS MULTIFAMILY OVERLAY DISTRICT\"\nAgenda Page 2 of 3 February 10 th Township Council Regular Meeting As of: 2/10/2026 O-26-04 AN ORDINANCE AMENDING CHAPTER 54 ENTITLED \"LAND USE AND DEVELOPMENT\" OF THE CODE OF THE TOWNSHIP OF ROCKAWAY CREATING A NEW SECTION 54-30.34 ENTITLED \"RMF-14 MULTIFAMILY RESIDENTIAL DISTRICT\" O-26-05 AN ORDINANCE AMENDING CHAPTER 54 ENTITLED \"LAND USE AND DEVELOPMENT\" OF THE CODE OF THE TOWNSHIP OF ROCKAWAY CREATING A NEW 