rgency Medical Services (DPREMS), in the amount of $301,813.00 (Department of Finance) (ID #14233) RES-2026-595. Resolution Authorizing the Insertion of a Special Item of Revenue into the 2026 Budget under Chapter 159, New Jersey Department of Human Services, Work First New Jersey, in the amount of $473,074.00 (Department of Finance) (ID #14235) RES-2026-596. Resolution Authorizing the Insertion of a Special Item of Revenue into the 2026 Budget under Chapter 159, New Jersey Department of Transportation, Indian Falls Road Bridge No. 1400-992, in the amount of $47,834.39 (Department of Finance) (ID #14240) RES-2026-597. Resolution Accepting Additional NJDOT Grant Funding in the Amount of $393,558.26 for the Replacement of County Bridge No. 1400-992 on Indian Falls Road over Jackson Brook in the Township of Mine Hill, County of Morris (Department of Public Works) (ID #14244) RES-2026-598. Resolution Authorizing the Insertion of a Special Item of Revenue into the 2026 Budget under Chapter 159, New Jersey Department of Transportation, Indian Falls Road Bridge No. 1400-992, in the amount of $393,558.26 (Department of Finance) (ID #14245) RES-2026-599. Resolution Authorizing the Submission of the 2026 Annual Action Plan (Department of Human Services) (ID #14226) RES-2026-600. Resolution Authorizing Anticipated Program Income Funds to be Funded Under the Housing Rehabilitation Program and Other CDBG Projects (Department of Human Services) (ID #14227) RES-2026-601. Resolution Authorizing Anticipated HOME Program Income and Recaptured funds to be allotted for eligible HOME Program activities (Department of Human Services) (ID #14228)\nJULY 22, 2026 REGULAR COMMISSIONER MEETING 5 | P a g e RES-2026-602. Resolution Authorizing Award of Contract for Bid # B26-111 As-Needed Traffic Signal and Electrician Services for Morris County Owned Traffic Signals to Jen Electric for $23,600.00 (Department of Public Works) (ID #14242) RES-2026-603. Resolution to Approve Renewal of Workforce 